{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Run-over-run IB cabling audit (LIVE). Compares the newest cable-issue scan against the previous 12h scan to show which miscablings are NEW and which are FIXED, plus freshness of the last scan. Fed by the ib-cable-issue exporter (:gb301) diff metrics: ib_cable_audit_*, ib_cable_issue_{current,new,resolved}_total, ib_cable_issue_change; reuses ib_cable_issue_by_switch. Baseline until the second 12h scan completes (compare_available=0).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "🏠 NVIS Home",
      "url": "/d/nvis-net-home/nvis-network-home?${__url_time_range}",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "tooltip": "Network Observability Home",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "🔌 Miswiring Worklist",
      "url": "/d/nvis-ib-cabling?${__url_time_range}",
      "icon": "external link",
      "tooltip": "Full expected-vs-actual re-patch worklist",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "Network Boards",
      "tags": [
        "network"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "title": "Read me — run-over-run cabling audit",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Cabling Audit (live) — are the miscablings getting fixed?\nThe scan runs on a **12h cron** and each run is **compared with the previous run**. **NEW** = faults that appeared since the last scan; **FIXED / RESOLVED** = faults that are gone since the last scan. Stable key = `(node, source_port, issue, expected_neighbor, discovered_neighbor)` over the four miswiring categories.\n\n⏱ **Freshness** below trips red at **13h** (12h cron + 1h grace). If it reads **NO SCAN**, the exporter has no snapshot loaded.\n\n⚠ **Baseline note:** on first deploy only one snapshot exists → **compare_available = 0** and NEW/RESOLVED read *no prior scan*. The **first** 12h scan re-establishes current; the **second** scan yields the first real NEW/FIXED numbers — that is when \"most of the cabling issues might have been fixed\" gets answered."
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Audit Freshness [LIVE]",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "title": "Audit Age (since last scan)",
      "description": "now − last scan timestamp, computed live in the exporter (ib_cable_audit_age_seconds). Green < 12h, yellow ≥ 12h, red ≥ 13h (12h cron + 1h grace). -1 / no series = NO SCAN loaded.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 43200
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 46800
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "NO SCAN",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "-1": {
                  "text": "NO SCAN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "NO SCAN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ib_cable_audit_age_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "age",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      },
      "title": "Last Scan",
      "description": "Wall-clock time of the newest cable-issue scan (ib_cable_audit_timestamp_seconds). 0 / no series = NO SCAN.",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "unit": "dateTimeFromNow",
          "noValue": "NO SCAN",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NO SCAN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ib_cable_audit_timestamp_seconds * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "last scan",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "title": "Compare Available",
      "description": "1 = a previous snapshot was diffable, so NEW/RESOLVED are real. 0 = baseline (only one scan present); NEW/RESOLVED read as no-prior-scan until the second 12h run (ib_cable_audit_compare_available).",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "NO PRIOR SCAN",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NO PRIOR SCAN",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "COMPARE LIVE",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ib_cable_audit_compare_available",
          "legendFormat": "compare",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6
      },
      "title": "Change Detail",
      "description": "0 = full per-item change detail emitted. 1 = per-item ib_cable_issue_change series were capped (>2000 changes in one run — e.g. a scan-methodology swing); totals still valid (ib_cable_audit_change_suppressed).",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "—",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "FULL DETAIL",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "SUPPRESSED (cap hit)",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ib_cable_audit_change_suppressed",
          "legendFormat": "suppressed",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      }
    },
    {
